        <div class="section-tag">Our Story</div>
        <h2>Why "Chief Cornerstone"?</h2>
        <p>In construction, the cornerstone is the first stone set — the one that determines the alignment and strength of everything built after it. If the cornerstone is solid, the structure stands. If it shifts, everything else follows.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">We named our company after the most important cornerstone of all — Jesus Christ. Not because it's trendy, but because it's true. We believe the way we do our work — honestly, carefully, and with genuine care for our clients — is a direct reflection of what we believe.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">That means we show up when we say we will. We charge what we quoted. We do the job right even when no one is watching. And when something goes wrong, we make it right.</p>
        <div class="scripture" style="margin-top:28px">
          <span>"So then you are no longer strangers and aliens, but you are fellow citizens with the saints and members of the household of God, built on the foundation of the apostles and prophets, Christ Jesus himself being the cornerstone."</span>
          <cite>— Ephesians 2:19-20</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
